**B14-Q1.** A team builds a custom MCP server wrapping their internal deployment system,
        intended for use by every engineer on the team, version-controlled alongside
        the rest of the repo's configuration.
A) Configure it in each engineer's personal `~/.claude.json` individually, copy-pasted
