        contains the phrase "always analyze transactions carefully," which happens
        to share a keyword with `analyze_transaction`'s name.
A) This is unrelated to tool selection; the fix must be in the tool descriptions
   themselves.
B) System prompt wording can create unintended keyword-level associations that override
   otherwise well-written tool descriptions — the fix should include reviewing the
   system prompt for such keyword sensitivity, not just the tool descriptions in
   isolation.
C) The fix is to rename `flag_suspicious_transaction` to also contain the word
   "analyze," so both tools share the keyword equally.
D) The fix is to remove `analyze_transaction` from the toolset entirely, regardless of
